#: fonts.cpp:280
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, KDE will smooth the edges of curves in fonts and "
"some images."
msgstr ""
"as hierdie opsie is gekose, kde sal glad die randte van kurwes in skriftipes "
"en sommige beelde."

#: fonts.cpp:319
msgid ""
"<h1>Fonts</h1> This module allows you to choose which fonts will be used to "
"display text in KDE. You can select not only the font family (for example, "
"<em>helvetica</em> or <em>times</em>), but also the attributes that make up "
"a specific font (for example, <em>bold</em> style and <em>12 points</em> in "
"height.)"
"<p> Just click the \"Choose\" button that is next to the font you want to "
"change. You can ask KDE to try and apply font and color settings to non-KDE "
"applications as well. See the \"Style\" control module for more information."
msgstr ""
"<h1>skriftipes</h1> hierdie module laat toe jy aan kies wat skriftipes sal "
"wees gebruik word aan vertoon teks in kde. jy kan kies nie slegs die skrif "
"tipe familie (vir voorbeeld, <em>helvetica</em> of <em> times </em>), maar "
"asook die eienskappe wat maak begin 'n spesifieke skrif tipe (vir voorbeeld, "
"<em>vetdruk</em> styl en <em>12 punte</em> in hoogte.)"
"<p>"
" net kliek die \"kies\" knoppie wat is volgende aan die skrif tipe jy wil "
"hê aan verander. jy kan vra kde aan probeer en wend aan skrif tipe en kleur "
"instellings aan nie-kde programme as goed. sien die \"styl\" kontrole module "
"vir meer informasie."

#: fonts.cpp:370
msgid ""
"You have changed anti-aliasing related settings.\n"
"This change will only affect newly started applications."
msgstr ""
"jy het het verander anti-aliasing verwanter instellings.\n"
"hierdie verander sal slegs affekteer nuwe beginne programme."

#: fonts.cpp:370
msgid "Anti-Aliasing Settings Changed"
msgstr "Anti-Aliasing instellings het verander"
